  <data name="AboutText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>MetadataManager {0}

Read, edit and remove file metadata.
Embedded metadata is read with MetadataExtractor and PDFs are processed with PDFsharp.
Editing EXIF tags and cleaning less common formats require ExifTool.</value>
